{"id":2163,"date":"2016-10-20T21:32:31","date_gmt":"2016-10-21T02:32:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=2163"},"modified":"2016-10-20T21:32:31","modified_gmt":"2016-10-21T02:32:31","slug":"please-dont-jump-its-not-that-bad","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/10\/20\/please-dont-jump-its-not-that-bad\/","title":{"rendered":"Please don&#8217;t jump &#8211; It&#8217;s not THAT bad!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>After visiting V- BAR- V State Historic Site and taking \u00a0a walk on down to cool and clean Beaver Creek, we still had a lot of daylight left to go exploring some more.<\/p>\n<p>We decided to drive on into, up, and over <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/10\/04\/our-trip-to-ghostown-jerome\/\" target=\"_blank\">Historic (haunted) Jerome<\/a> and go check out the campground at Mingus Mountain.\u00a0Located in the cool pines atop Mingus Mountain, this campground offers a spectacular view of the Verde Valley, the red rocks of Sedona, the San Francisco Peaks near Flagstaff, and the Mogollon Rim.<\/p>\n<p>After taking a drive through the campground and looking from the scenic overlook, we drove across and onto an unmarked trail, not sure where it would take us. \u00a0What a treat! \u00a0Turns out this unmarked trail led to another peak of the mountain where there are at least a dozen cell phone and radio towers, a small private (club) campground AND the official launch site of the ARIZONA HANG GLIDERS ASSOCIATION!<\/p>\n<p>Take a look at the slide show below along with the video of daredevil Kathy &#8230;<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-2163 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/10\/2016-10-17-15-12-07.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/10\/2016-10-17-15-12-07-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-2164\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-2164'>\n\t\t\t\tSee the whole Verde Valley from atop Mingus Mountain\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/10\/2016-10-17-15-36-17.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/10\/2016-10-17-15-36-17-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-2165\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-2165'>\n\t\t\t\tArizona Hang Glider Assoc Notice Board\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/10\/2016-10-17-15-36-36.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/10\/2016-10-17-15-36-36-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-2166\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-2166'>\n\t\t\t\tPlease don&#8217;t jump &#8211; It&#8217;s not THAT bad!\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/10\/2016-10-17-15-36-56.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/10\/2016-10-17-15-36-56-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-2167\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-2167'>\n\t\t\t\tHang glider&#8217;s launch pad @ 7815 feet elevation\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/10\/2016-10-17-15-58-38.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/10\/2016-10-17-15-58-38-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-2168\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-2168'>\n\t\t\t\tMingus Mountain is in the Prescott National Forest just west of Jerome, AZ\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/10\/2016-10-17-16-00-37.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/10\/2016-10-17-16-00-37-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-2169\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-2169'>\n\t\t\t\tThis is a shot of the road on our way back down the mountain\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>[youtube https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=rAxtQlrGclY&amp;w=560&amp;h=315]<\/p>\n<p>Just another fascinating place to see in the Verde Valley area.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>After visiting V- BAR- V State Historic Site and taking \u00a0a walk on down to cool and clean Beaver Creek, we still had a lot of daylight left to go exploring some more. We decided to drive on into, up, and over Historic (haunted) Jerome and go check out the campground at Mingus Mountain.\u00a0Located in &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/10\/20\/please-dont-jump-its-not-that-bad\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Please don&#8217;t jump &#8211; It&#8217;s not THAT bad!<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[19546],"tags":[596421,4423510],"class_list":["post-2163","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-sightseeing","tag-hang-gliding","tag-mingus-mountain"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2163","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2163"}],"version-history":[{"count":18,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2163\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2189,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2163\/revisions\/2189"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2163"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=2163"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=2163"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}